  "description": "Folds code-first SQL Server database objects into EF Core migrations: stored procedures as CREATE OR ALTER / DROP operations, partition functions and schemes, tables created on a partition scheme, clustered columnstore indexes, and full-text catalogs and indexes — all declared on the model, carried by the snapshot and diffed by a custom IMigrationsModelDiffer, so they travel in the same migration as the table changes. Targets EF Core 10.",
